    {
      "name": "post_decision",
      "description": "Post a design decision for a human to review: the current image(s) and the proposed option(s), per cell (desktop-light, phone-light, …). A human decides; you never can. Returns the decision number and queue position. Idempotent on client_request_id. A 429 queue_full means wait retry_after_s. Posting again with the same target_key supersedes your own open decision on it. repo, repo_path and branch are detected from git when omitted. Cards link from card_ids, else the Card: trailer in pr_body, else a branch like fix/<card-id>-….",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "client_request_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 128
          },
          "repo": {
